X-WR-CALNAME:Quarterly Tax Deadlines (2026–2027)
X-WR-CALDESC:US federal quarterly estimated tax deadlines from SideHustleGuard's Quarterly Tax System. Most states with income tax mirror these dates.
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:q1-2026@sidehustleguard.com
DTSTAMP:20260512T012156Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260416
SUMMARY:Q1 Estimated Tax Payment Due (Tax Year 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Federal quarterly estimated tax payment due to the IRS\, covering January – March of tax year 2026.\n\nPay one of three ways:\n  • IRS Direct Pay — irs.gov/payments/direct-pay (fastest)\n  • EFTPS — eftps.gov (best for permanent payment history)\n  • Mail Form 1040-ES with a check\n\nIf you live in a state with income tax\, you likely owe a state quarterly payment on the same date — check your state revenue department's site.\n\nThis calendar from your Quarterly Tax System purchase from SideHustleGuard.\nsidehustleguard.com
LOCATION:irs.gov/payments/direct-pay
CATEGORIES:Tax,SideHustleGuard
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P7D
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Q1 quarterly tax due in 1 week (20260415)
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P1D
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Q1 quarterly tax due TOMORROW
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
